  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat grill to medium-high heat (180°C).",
    "2. In a large bowl, whisk together marinade, smoked paprika, and salt.",
    "3. Add beef strips to the marinade and mix until coated.",
    "4. Thread marinated beef onto wooden skewers.",
